 'Mahua Sen is a Hyderabad-based poet, author, editor and translator. Her books include the poetry collection Nostalgia: Crafting a Home Within, published by Red River, and The Dead Fish, her English translation of Rajkamal Chaudhary’s Hindi novel Machhli Mari Hui. Her work has appeared in literary journals and newspapers including Outlook and Teesta Review.',
